    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Meals of the day",
     "texto": [
      "**O pequeno-almoço** is breakfast, **o almoço** is lunch and **o jantar** is dinner.",
      "The verbs: **tomar o pequeno-almoço** (to have breakfast), **almoçar** (to have lunch) and **jantar** (to have dinner).",
      "**Tomar banho** = to have a shower or bath.",
      "Times of day: **de manhã** (in the morning), **à tarde** (in the afternoon), **à noite** (in the evening). **Cedo** = early. **Tarde** = late. **Depois** = afterwards."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
